  "details": "With the wave of generative AI content used throughout games/platforms that run on user-generated content such as VRChat, it should be required that creators tag their avatars & worlds appropriately with \"Contains Generative AI Content\" when the avatar/world contains ANY generative AI assets/content.\n\nThe goal is so that users who do not wish to see such content, can filter it out through VRChat's native Content Gating system.\n\nScreenshot below as an example.",
